From: DockSeed <dockseed@proton.me>
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: gpu: img,powervr-rogue: OPP table, supply and
 cooling cells

drm/imagination can scale its core clock with an OPP table
(`drm-imagination-scale-the-core-clock-with-the-firmware-s-utilisation`).
Allow operating-points-v2, the supply the OPPs set (power-supply) and
#cooling-cells for the devfreq cooling device. All three are optional.

Assisted-by: Claude
---
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/img,powervr-rogue.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/img,powervr-rogue.yaml
@@ -72,6 +72,16 @@
   resets:
     maxItems: 1
 
+  operating-points-v2: true
+
+  power-supply:
+    description:
+      Supply of the GPU core. With an OPP table it is set to the voltage of
+      the current OPP.
+
+  "#cooling-cells":
+    const: 2
+
 required:
   - compatible
   - reg
